# Shared sources materialized into this plugin.
#   <path under shared/>  ->  <path under this plugin>
#
# Destinations are per-skill: a SKILL.md resolves bundled paths relative to its own
# folder, so each skill needs its own copy.
#
# Regenerate with: python3 tools/materialize.py

references/review-standard.md -> skills/review-code/references/review-standard.md
scripts/detect_stack.py       -> skills/review-code/scripts/detect_stack.py

references/review-standard.md -> skills/setup-review-rules/references/review-standard.md
scripts/detect_stack.py       -> skills/setup-review-rules/scripts/detect_stack.py
